{{-- What the library promises, in four cards. --}}

<ul class="landing-features" aria-label="Why it works this way">
  <li>
    <icon name="lucide:clipboard-copy" />
    <h3>Copy, don't install</h3>
    <p>Each component is a file you paste into <code>src/components/ui/</code>. Change anything: it's yours.</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <icon name="lucide:feather" />
    <h3>No JavaScript unless it needs it</h3>
    <p>
      Cards, badges, tables and charts render on the server and ship nothing. Dialogs and tabs ship a few hundred bytes.
    </p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <icon name="lucide:accessibility" />
    <h3>Accessible by default</h3>
    <p>Native elements first, keyboard paths and ARIA where they're not enough, and every page tested with axe.</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <icon name="lucide:palette" />
    <h3>Themed by tokens</h3>
    <p>
      About forty <code>--ui-</code> tokens, light and dark. Tune them in the Theme sheet and copy one
      <code>theme.css</code>.
    </p>
  </li>
</ul>

<style scoped>
  :scope {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 15rem), 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 24px 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  li {
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    align-content: start;
    padding: 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
  h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 17px;
  }
  p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
